.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
# The conformance harness is not consumed by the cs-api-server image. The
# deployment probe reuses exactly one event-driven readiness helper; reopen
# only its parent path and source while keeping tests, fixtures, run artifacts,
# and ETS metadata out of the build context.
conformance
!conformance
conformance/*
!conformance/cmd
conformance/cmd/*
!conformance/cmd/index-readiness
conformance/cmd/index-readiness/*
!conformance/cmd/index-readiness/main.go
# OpenSpec design records and archived qualification evidence are never image
# inputs. In particular, keep retained XML, logs, and persistence JSON out of
# both the production and deployment-probe build contexts.
openspec
docs
README.md
CLAUDE.md
*.md
LICENSE
